Name            Technique	                    Main hypothesis
---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
noop            No change	                    Baseline
clahe           Local contrast enhancement      Improve roofs in shadows
gamma           Gamma correction	            Improve dark or bright regions
sharpen         Unsharp masking                 Improve roof boundaries
bilateral       Edge-preserving denoising       Reduce texture while preserving edges
equalize        Global histogram equalization	Improve overall contrast
edge_enhance    Edge-map blending               Emphasize building outlines
